  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This organization wants to proactively promote and strengthen a social environment that respects human rights, where diversity is recognized as a value, with emphasis on the development of vulnerable groups such as young people, people with HIV, men who have sex with other men, the LGBT community, among others. They will achieve this through the promotion of sports, positive models of coexistence and collaboration with indigenous government institutions and key actors of civil society.</narrative>
